History and attribution
-----------------------

CINES began in 2012 as a Qt 4 chess program written by:

    Sagar Rakshe    srrakshe@gmail.com
    Nisarg Patel
    Sanket Sudake   sanketsudake@gmail.com
    Nikhil Pachpande

with a later Qt 5 compatibility patch from Chozabu <chozabu@gmail.com>.

That work was published under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or
later, and remains available under those terms in this repository's history at
any commit up to and including 3e28a06.

The program was rewritten in 2026. None of the 2012 source code is present in
the current work: the rules, the interface, the build and the packaging were
all written from scratch. The piece artwork was likewise replaced, and is
generated by packaging/generate-pieces.py, so that no part of what is
distributed today derives from the original authors' contributions.

The name, the idea, and the original authors' part in starting it are recorded
here because they earned it, not because the licence requires it.
